                                                "sense_id": "18c01793-d5aa-32ed-8e6a-84644700bcac",
                                                "text": "In my mind, the burkini was always the practical, inevitable swimwear goal; the final stage in my journey to becoming a proper hijabi."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "469d7184-9b76-4e38-bbe2-13c35d81eb2a",
                                                "sense_id": "18c01793-d5aa-32ed-8e6a-84644700bcac",
                                                "text": "In recent days, people on Twitter and other social media platforms have mocked the banning of burkinis by dozens of French beachside towns by asking what French officials would do if Chinese beachgoers showed up wearing facekinis."
                                            }
